</p><a href="https://gigazine.net/news/20260609-apple-wwdc26-macos-27/" target="_blank"><img src="https://i.gzn.jp/img/2026/06/09/apple-wwdc26-macos-27/00.png" border="0" alt="" class="lzsmall"></a><p class="preface">
